 PROGRAM-ID. CHUNK-CONTAINER-ENCODE.
*> USING PB-BUFFER, values (BINARY-LONG table), entry count (BINARY-LONG 4096 or 64), strategy
*> (BINARY-LONG 0 = block states, 1 = biomes), global palette bits (BINARY-LONG): a PalettedContainer
*> (06 §5): single value for one distinct value, else Linear/HashMap up to 8 bits (blocks, at least 4)
*> or 3 bits (biomes), else Global at the global palette bits (06 §5.3). Data entries are packed at
*> the data bits, floor(64 / bits) per Long, entry 0 in the lowest bits, none spanning two Longs.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-I                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-J                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-SIZE                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-BITS                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-DATA-BITS           BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-LIMIT               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-MINIMUM             BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-PER-LONG            BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-LONGS               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-POW-TABLE.
    05 WS-POW              PIC 9(20) OCCURS 64 TIMES.   *> WS-POW(k) = 2 ** (k - 1)
 01 WS-PALETTE-TABLE.
    05 WS-PALETTE          BINARY-LONG OCCURS 4096 TIMES.
 01 WS-INDEX-TABLE.
    05 WS-INDEX            BINARY-LONG OCCURS 4096 TIMES.
 01 WS-WORD                PIC X(8).
 01 WS-SIGNED REDEFINES WS-WORD BINARY-DOUBLE SIGNED.
 01 WS-UNSIGNED REDEFINES WS-WORD BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
 01 B-VALUES BASED.
    05 B-VALUE             BINARY-LONG OCCURS 4096 TIMES.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY PROTO.
 01 L-VALUES               PIC X.
 01 L-COUNT                BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-STRATEGY             BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-GLOBAL-BITS          BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING PB-BUFFER L-VALUES L-COUNT L-STRATEGY L-GLOBAL-BITS.
     SET ADDRESS OF B-VALUES TO ADDRESS OF L-VALUES
     MOVE 0 TO WS-SIZE
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > L-COUNT
         PERFORM VARYING WS-J FROM 1 BY 1
                 UNTIL WS-J > WS-SIZE OR WS-PALETTE(WS-J) = B-VALUE(WS-I)
             CONTINUE
         END-PERFORM
         IF WS-J > WS-SIZE
             MOVE WS-J TO WS-SIZE
             MOVE B-VALUE(WS-I) TO WS-PALETTE(WS-J)
         END-IF
         COMPUTE WS-INDEX(WS-I) = WS-J - 1
     END-PERFORM
     MOVE 0 TO WS-BITS
     PERFORM UNTIL 2 ** WS-BITS >= WS-SIZE
         ADD 1 TO WS-BITS
     END-PERFORM
     COMPUTE WS-LIMIT = 8 - 5 * L-STRATEGY
     COMPUTE WS-MINIMUM = 4 - 3 * L-STRATEGY
     EVALUATE TRUE
         WHEN WS-BITS = 0
             MOVE 0 TO WS-DATA-BITS
             CALL "PB-PUT-UBYTE" USING PB-BUFFER WS-DATA-BITS
             CALL "PB-PUT-VARINT" USING PB-BUFFER WS-PALETTE(1)
         WHEN WS-BITS <= WS-LIMIT
             COMPUTE WS-DATA-BITS = FUNCTION MAX(WS-BITS, WS-MINIMUM)
             CALL "PB-PUT-UBYTE" USING PB-BUFFER WS-DATA-BITS
             CALL "PB-PUT-VARINT" USING PB-BUFFER WS-SIZE
             PERFORM VARYING WS-J FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-J > WS-SIZE
                 CALL "PB-PUT-VARINT" USING PB-BUFFER WS-PALETTE(WS-J)
             END-PERFORM
         WHEN OTHER
             MOVE L-GLOBAL-BITS TO WS-DATA-BITS
             CALL "PB-PUT-UBYTE" USING PB-BUFFER WS-DATA-BITS
             PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > L-COUNT
                 MOVE B-VALUE(WS-I) TO WS-INDEX(WS-I)
             END-PERFORM
     END-EVALUATE
     IF WS-DATA-BITS > 0
         MOVE 1 TO WS-POW(1)
         PERFORM VARYING WS-J FROM 2 BY 1 UNTIL WS-J > 64
             COMPUTE WS-POW(WS-J) = WS-POW(WS-J - 1) * 2
         END-PERFORM
         COMPUTE WS-PER-LONG = 64 / WS-DATA-BITS
         COMPUTE WS-LONGS = (L-COUNT + WS-PER-LONG - 1) / WS-PER-LONG
         MOVE 1 TO WS-I
         PERFORM WS-LONGS TIMES
             MOVE 0 TO WS-UNSIGNED
             PERFORM VARYING WS-J FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL WS-J = WS-PER-LONG OR WS-I > L-COUNT
                 COMPUTE WS-UNSIGNED = WS-UNSIGNED
                     + WS-INDEX(WS-I) * WS-POW(WS-J * WS-DATA-BITS + 1)
                 ADD 1 TO WS-I
             END-PERFORM
             CALL "PB-PUT-LONG" USING PB-BUFFER WS-SIGNED
         END-PERFORM
     END-IF
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM CHUNK-CONTAINER-ENCODE.

